RequestProcessorPattern: {shape: class; "+Id = mediatr.request-processor"; "+Find(root, model)"; "+Rewrite(node, model)"; "-ResponseOf(message, model, position)"; "-HasOtherUses(symbol, declaration, model)"; "-IsOpenRegistration(name)"}
